<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HCIA raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HCIA raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens said it upgraded HCIA Inc to buy from long-term attractive.</p>
<p>-- Estimates earnings at $1.26 per share in 1997 and $1.80 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Michael Samols called HCIA &quot;undervalued by almost any valuation method.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/8 to 19.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
